sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Sender
    participant R as Receiver
    S->>R: SYN
    R->>S: SYN-ACK
    S->>R: ACK (connection open, cwnd = 1)
    S->>R: Segments 1-4
    R-->>S: ACK 5
    S-xR: Segment 5 (lost)
    S->>R: Segments 6-8
    R-->>S: dup ACK 5
    R-->>S: dup ACK 5
    R-->>S: dup ACK 5
    Note over S: 3 duplicate ACKs: fast retransmit,<br/>ssthresh = cwnd / 2
    S->>R: Segment 5 (retransmitted)
    R-->>S: ACK 9
    Note over S,R: Reno: fast recovery, cwnd = ssthresh,<br/>then +1 segment per round trip
